    "body": "MAS-Lab v0.2 adds MCP and A2A integration through IOA, agentskills.io-compatible skills, and runtime validation and observability improvements. See the [release notes](https://github.com/outshift-open/mas-lab/blob/v0.2.0/RELEASE-NOTES.md) and [changelog](https://github.com/outshift-open/mas-lab/blob/v0.2.0/CHANGELOG.md) for details.\n\n### Container images (linux/amd64)\n\n- UI: `ghcr.io/outshift-open/mas-lab/ui:0.2.0-02cfa4d`\n- Backend: `ghcr.io/outshift-open/mas-lab/backend:0.2.0-02cfa4d`\n\nBoth images were built and pushed from commit `02cfa4d220a54e91dc8a76e14ec4da28f9bd2dc1` by the [container workflow](https://github.com/outshift-open/mas-lab/actions/runs/36758761713). Source code archives (zip and tar.gz) are available in Assets below.\n\n### Python packages\n\nPyPI publication did not complete: the Trusted Publisher configuration was rejected (`invalid-publisher`). No Python distributions are attached to this GitHub Release; do not assume v0.2.0 is available on PyPI. This does not affect the source archives or the container images."
